**[Verse 1]**
Chords: Am | Am | Am | Am | F | F | C | C | G | G | Am | Am  
Melody: (phrase 1: "Hello darkness, my old friend")  
Lyrics:  
Hello darkness, my old friend  
I've come to talk with you again  
Because a vision softly creeping  
Left its seeds while I was sleeping  
And the vision that was planted in my brain  
Still remains  
Within the sound of silence  

@player guitar: `arpeggio per chord, 8th notes, pattern: (root, 5th, 3rd, 5th) repeated`  
@player bass: `root notes on beats 1 & 3, fifth on beat 3 of F and C`  
@player drums: `steady 8th-note hi-hat, kick on 1 & 3, snare on 2 & 4`  
@player vocals: `melody contour: Am (low), F (rise), C (peak), G (fall), Am (resolve)`

---

**[Verse 2]**
Chords: Am | Am | Am | Am | F | F | C | C | G | G | Am | Am  
Melody: (phrase 2: "In restless dreams I walked alone")  
Lyrics:  
In restless dreams I walked alone  
Narrow streets of cobblestone  
'Neath the halo of a street lamp  
I turned my collar to the cold and damp  
When my eyes were stabbed by the flash of a neon light  
That split the night  
And touched the sound of silence  

@player guitar: `same arpeggio, add light fingerpicking variation on F and C (add 4th string)`  
@player bass: `add passing tone on beat 4 of G (G#) to lead into Am`  
@player drums: `add rimshot on snare for accent at end of each phrase`  
@player vocals: `slightly more intense, hold longer on "silence"`

---

**[Chorus]**
Chords: F | F | C | C | G | G | Am | Am | F | F | C | C | G | G | Am | Am  
Melody: (phrase 3: "And in the naked light I saw")  
Lyrics:  
And in the naked light I saw  
Ten thousand people, maybe more  
People talking without speaking  
People hearing without listening  
People writing songs that voices never share  
And no one dare  
Disturb the sound of silence  

